## What This Document Doesn't Cover

- The [Cloud Agents REST API](https://cursor.com/docs/cloud-agent/api/endpoints) (`/v1/agents/*`) -- use from languages without a first-party SDK, or when you want a minimal HTTP surface
- `.cursor/hooks.json` hooks -- both SDKs respect them; neither manages them
- Self-hosted cloud (private workers, self-hosted pools, my-machines)
- SDKs in languages other than TypeScript and Python -- the REST API is the portable option there

